    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>CamelPlug Audio Player Block allows you to add an audio player directly inside the WordPress block editor.</p>\n<p>You can select an audio file from the Media Library and display a clean, minimal audio player on the frontend. An optional download button lets visitors download the audio file if enabled.</p>\n<p>The block follows WordPress coding standards and works with all properly coded themes.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin uses third-party services to load SVG icons used in the block interface.</p>\n<p>Services used:<br />\n&#8211; Iconify (https://api.iconify.design)<br />\n&#8211; SimpleSVG (https://api.simplesvg.com)<br />\n&#8211; UniSVG (https://api.unisvg.com)</p>\n<p>What data is sent:<br />\n&#8211; Only icon request URLs<br />\n&#8211; No personal user data is collected or stored</p>\n<p>When data is sent:<br />\n&#8211; When icons are rendered in the block editor or frontend</p>\n<p>Privacy policy:<br />\n&#8211; https://iconify.design/privacy</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 (or later).</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open the block editor and insert <strong>CamelPlug Audio Player Block</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It follows WordPress block standards and works with any properly coded theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20disable%20the%20download%20button%3F\">\nCan I disable the download button?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The download button is optional and only appears when an audio file is selected.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A lightweight audio player block for the WordPress block editor with an optional download button.",
    "description": "<p>CamelPlug Audio Player Block allows you to add an audio player directly inside the WordPress block editor.</p>\n<p>You can select an audio file from the Media Library and display a clean, minimal audio player on the frontend. An optional download button lets visitors download the audio file if enabled.</p>\n<p>The block follows WordPress coding standards and works with all properly coded themes.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin uses third-party services to load SVG icons used in the block interface.</p>\n<p>Services used:<br />\n&#8211; Iconify (https://api.iconify.design)<br />\n&#8211; SimpleSVG (https://api.simplesvg.com)<br />\n&#8211; UniSVG (https://api.unisvg.com)</p>\n<p>What data is sent:<br />\n&#8211; Only icon request URLs<br />\n&#8211; No personal user data is collected or stored</p>\n<p>When data is sent:<br />\n&#8211; When icons are rendered in the block editor or frontend</p>\n<p>Privacy policy:<br />\n&#8211; https://iconify.design/privacy</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 (or later).</p>\n",
